---
interface Props { mode: 'ip' | 'log' }
const { mode } = Astro.props;
const logs = mode === 'log';
---

<div class="traffic-workbench" data-mode={mode}>
  <section class="traffic-hero">
    <div class="traffic-eyebrow"><span class="traffic-live-dot"></span> NETWORK INTELLIGENCE <span class="traffic-hero-divider">/</span> BUG DAYS</div>
    <div class="traffic-hero-heading">
      <div><h1>{logs ? 'Make sense of your traffic.' : 'Bulk Cloud & Hosting IP Lookup'}</h1>
        <p>{logs ? 'Turn access logs into a clear picture of requests, errors, crawlers, cloud networks, and hosting providers.' : 'Check one IP or an entire list for AWS, Azure, Google Cloud, Oracle, DigitalOcean, Hetzner, OVHcloud, Hostinger, CDNs, service networks, and published crawler ranges. Inspect the evidence, then share or export the report.'}</p></div>
      <div class="traffic-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><span>IP</span><i></i><b></b><em></em></div>
    </div>
    <div class="traffic-hero-footer"><span>◈ &nbsp; Raw logs stay in your browser</span><span>↗ &nbsp; Shareable investigation reports</span><span>↓ &nbsp; CSV, Excel & JSON</span></div>
  </section>

  <nav class="traffic-switcher" aria-label="Traffic tools">
    <a href="/ip-lookup/" class:list={{ active: !logs }} aria-current={!logs ? 'page' : undefined}>IP & cloud lookup</a>
    <a href="/access-log-analyzer/" class:list={{ active: logs }} aria-current={logs ? 'page' : undefined}>Access-log analyzer</a>
    <span id="traffic-data-status" role="status">Official feeds + current BGP ranges</span>
  </nav>

  <div class="traffic-grid">
    <section class="traffic-card traffic-input-card">
      <div class="traffic-section-heading"><div><span class="traffic-step">01 / INPUT</span><h2>{logs ? 'Your access logs' : 'Your IP addresses'}</h2></div><button type="button" id="traffic-clear" class="traffic-text-button">Clear</button></div>
      <label for="traffic-input" class="traffic-input-label">{logs ? 'Paste Nginx, Apache, or JSON access logs' : 'Paste IPv4, IPv6, or text containing IPs'}</label>
      <textarea id="traffic-input" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" placeholder={logs ? '3.5.140.1 - - [14/Sep/2026:10:00:00 +0000] "GET /api/orders HTTP/1.1" 200 1240' : '3.5.140.1\n34.80.0.1\n104.16.0.1\n66.249.66.1\n2001:db8::1'}></textarea>
      <div class="traffic-input-meta"><span id="traffic-input-size">No input yet</span><label><input id="traffic-auto" type="checkbox" checked /> Auto-analyze</label></div>
      <div id="traffic-drop-zone" class="traffic-drop-zone"><input id="traffic-file" type="file" accept=".txt,.log,.csv,.json,.jsonl,.ndjson,.gz" class="sr-only" /><button type="button" id="traffic-upload">Choose a file</button><span>or drop it here · up to 20 MB expanded</span></div>
      <div class="traffic-action-row"><button id="traffic-analyze" type="button" class="traffic-button traffic-primary">{logs ? 'Analyze traffic' : 'Look up addresses'} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><button id="traffic-cancel" type="button" class="traffic-button" hidden>Cancel</button></div>
      <div id="traffic-progress" hidden><progress max="100" value="0" aria-label="Analysis progress"></progress><span>Preparing your report…</span></div>
      <div class="traffic-example"><span>JUST EXPLORING?</span><button id="traffic-demo" type="button">{logs ? 'Try an example traffic log' : 'Try a mix of cloud IPs'} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div>
      <details class="traffic-format-help"><summary>{logs ? 'Supported log formats' : 'What can I paste?'}</summary>
        {logs ? <p>Apache / Nginx common and combined formats, or one JSON object per line. JSON accepts <code>remote_addr</code>, <code>remoteAddress</code>, <code>client_ip</code>, <code>ClientIP</code>, or <code>ip</code>; a status and request path are required. Timing charts use dated entries. JSON <code>request_time</code> is seconds; <code>duration_ms</code> is milliseconds. Forwarded headers are not selected automatically.</p> : <p>One address per line, comma-separated lists, or text with addresses. IPv4-mapped IPv6 addresses are grouped with their IPv4 equivalent. IPs are extracted as written; hostnames and CIDR ranges are not expanded.</p>}
        <p>Supports up to 200,000 lines and 20,000 unique IPs. You can also reopen an exported Bug Days report JSON file here.</p>
      </details>
    </section>

    <div class="traffic-results-column">
      <div id="traffic-error" class="traffic-message traffic-error" role="alert" hidden></div>
      <div id="traffic-notice" class="traffic-message" role="status" hidden></div>
      <section id="traffic-empty" class="traffic-card traffic-empty">
        <div class="traffic-empty-graphic" aria-hidden="true"><span>INPUT</span><i>······</i><b>◈</b><i>······</i><span>INSIGHT</span></div>
        <h2>{logs ? 'A clearer view of every request.' : 'Every address has a little more to tell.'}</h2>
        <p>{logs ? 'See who is calling, which paths get attention, and where errors gather. Paste a log or start with the example.' : 'Match addresses to published networks, spot crawler ranges, and share an organized report. Start with your own list or try the example.'}</p>
        <div class="traffic-provider-pills"><span>AWS</span><span>Azure</span><span>Google Cloud</span><span>DigitalOcean</span><span>Hetzner</span><span>OVHcloud</span><span>Hostinger</span><span>AI crawlers</span></div>
        <p class="traffic-empty-note">No account or API key needed. Only extracted IP addresses are sent for matching.</p>
      </section>

      <div id="traffic-report" hidden>
        <section class="traffic-card traffic-report-heading">
          <div><span class="traffic-step">02 / YOUR REPORT</span><label for="traffic-title" class="sr-only">Report title</label><input id="traffic-title" maxlength="120" value={logs ? 'Traffic investigation' : 'IP investigation'} /><p id="traffic-report-meta"></p></div>
          <button id="traffic-share" type="button" class="traffic-button traffic-primary">Share report ↗</button>
        </section>
        <div id="traffic-summary" class="traffic-stats"></div>
        <div class="traffic-chart-grid">
          <section class="traffic-card traffic-chart-card"><div class="traffic-section-heading"><h2>Network mix</h2><span id="traffic-mix-unit"></span></div><div id="traffic-provider-chart"></div></section>
          <section class="traffic-card traffic-chart-card"><div class="traffic-section-heading"><h2>{logs ? 'Response status' : 'Address breakdown'}</h2><span>{logs ? 'HTTP' : 'IPv4 + IPv6'}</span></div><div id="traffic-secondary-chart"></div></section>
        </div>
        {logs && <section class="traffic-card traffic-timeline-card"><div class="traffic-section-heading"><h2>Request timeline</h2><span id="traffic-timeline-label">UTC</span></div><div id="traffic-timeline"></div><div id="traffic-time-range" class="traffic-time-range"></div><p id="traffic-latency" class="traffic-small"></p></section>}
        <section class="traffic-card traffic-table-card">
          <div class="traffic-section-heading"><div><h2>Address explorer</h2><span id="traffic-row-count"></span></div><button type="button" id="traffic-reset-filters" class="traffic-text-button">Reset filters</button></div>
          <div class="traffic-filters"><label><span class="sr-only">Search addresses, ranges, or regions</span><input id="traffic-search" type="search" placeholder="Search IP, provider, region, or CIDR…" /></label><label><span class="sr-only">Provider</span><select id="traffic-source"><option value="">All providers</option></select></label><label><span class="sr-only">Classification</span><select id="traffic-category"><option value="">All types</option><option value="cloud">Cloud</option><option value="hosting">Hosting / VPS</option><option value="cdn">CDN / proxy</option><option value="service">Service network</option><option value="crawler">Crawler range</option><option value="special">Special-use IP</option><option value="unmatched">No match</option></select></label><label><span class="sr-only">Sort addresses</span><select id="traffic-sort"><option value="count">Most occurrences</option><option value="address">IP address</option>{logs && <option value="errors">Most errors</option>}</select></label></div>
          <div class="traffic-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">IP address</th><th scope="col">Network / classification</th><th scope="col">Region / evidence</th><th scope="col" class="traffic-number">{logs ? 'Requests' : 'Count'}</th>{logs && <th scope="col" class="traffic-number">4xx / 5xx</th>}<th scope="col"><span class="sr-only">Details</span></th></tr></thead><tbody id="traffic-ip-rows"></tbody></table></div>
          <div class="traffic-pagination"><span id="traffic-page-label"></span><div><button type="button" id="traffic-prev" class="traffic-button">← Previous</button><button type="button" id="traffic-next" class="traffic-button">Next →</button></div></div>
        </section>
        {logs && <section class="traffic-card traffic-paths-card"><div class="traffic-section-heading"><h2>Most requested paths</h2><span>Query strings excluded</span></div><div id="traffic-paths"></div></section>}
        <section class="traffic-card traffic-export-card"><div><h2>Take the findings with you.</h2><p id="traffic-share-description">Share a snapshot or export your results.</p></div><div class="traffic-export-actions"><button type="button" id="traffic-csv" class="traffic-button">CSV</button><button type="button" id="traffic-xlsx" class="traffic-button">Excel</button><button type="button" id="traffic-json" class="traffic-button">Report JSON</button><button type="button" id="traffic-copy" class="traffic-button">Copy table</button><button type="button" id="traffic-print" class="traffic-button">Print / PDF</button></div></section>
        <details class="traffic-card traffic-source-card"><summary>Sources, coverage & parsing details</summary><div id="traffic-sources"></div><p>Matches describe published IP ranges, not the identity or intent of a visitor. An unmatched IP can still belong to a cloud provider. Published regions describe the network range, not a visitor’s physical location. Cloudflare ranges can identify an intermediary; use your correctly configured client-IP logs to investigate the original visitor.</p><div id="traffic-issues"></div></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <dialog id="traffic-detail" class="traffic-detail-dialog" aria-labelledby="traffic-detail-title"><div class="traffic-detail-heading"><div><span class="traffic-step">ADDRESS DETAILS</span><h2 id="traffic-detail-title"></h2></div><button type="button" id="traffic-detail-close" class="traffic-button" aria-label="Close address details">✕</button></div><div id="traffic-detail-body"></div><button type="button" id="traffic-share-ip" class="traffic-button traffic-primary">Share this IP ↗</button></dialog>
  <div id="traffic-toast" class="traffic-toast" role="status" hidden></div>
</div>

<script>
  import { initTrafficWorkbench } from '../lib/traffic-app';
  initTrafficWorkbench();
</script>

<style is:global>
  .traffic-workbench { --tw-surface:#fff; --tw-muted:#64748b; --tw-border:#e2e8f0; --tw-soft:#f8fafc; --tw-ink:#17253c; --tw-accent:#4f46e5; max-width:1450px; margin:0 auto; color:var(--tw-ink); }
  .dark .traffic-workbench { --tw-surface:#152033; --tw-muted:#a0aec2; --tw-border:#2a3950; --tw-soft:#101a2b; --tw-ink:#e5edf9; --tw-accent:#a5b4fc; }
  .traffic-workbench [hidden] { display:none !important; }
  .traffic-workbench button, .traffic-workbench a, .traffic-workbench summary { -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent; }
  .traffic-workbench button { cursor:pointer; }
  .traffic-workbench button:disabled { opacity:.45; cursor:default; }
  .traffic-workbench :is(button,a,input,textarea,select,summary):focus-visible { outline:3px solid #818cf8; outline-offset:3px; }
  .traffic-hero { position:relative; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid #dfe5f9; border-radius:20px; padding:28px 32px 20px; background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 100% 0%,#d5f7ec 0,transparent 48%),linear-gradient(120deg,#eef2ff,#f9fbff 65%); }
  .dark .traffic-hero { border-color:#2b3c56; background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 100% 0%,#123e3c 0,transparent 50%),linear-gradient(120deg,#1e2850,#172239 65%); }
  .traffic-eyebrow { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; font-size:10px; font-weight:750; letter-spacing:.14em; color:var(--tw-accent); }
  .traffic-live-dot { width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:100%; background:#0d9488; box-shadow:0 0 0 4px #14b8a614; }
  .traffic-hero-divider { opacity:.4; margin:0 4px; }
  .traffic-hero-heading { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:20px; }
  .traffic-hero h1 { font-size:clamp(26px,3.2vw,42px); line-height:1.15; letter-spacing:-.045em; font-weight:750; margin:16px 0 12px; }
  .traffic-hero p { font-size:14px; line-height:1.7; color:var(--tw-muted); max-width:610px; }
  .traffic-hero-footer { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px 24px; font-size:11px; color:var(--tw-muted); margin-top:23px; }
  .traffic-orbit { position:relative; width:112px; height:112px; border:1px solid #14b8a64a; border-radius:50%; flex-shrink:0; margin-right:10px; display:grid; place-items:center; }
  .traffic-orbit:before { content:''; position:absolute; inset:15px; border:1px dashed #6366f150; border-radius:50%; }
  .traffic-orbit span { border:1px solid #818cf860; background:var(--tw-surface); box-shadow:0 5px 20px #4f46e51a; border-radius:17px; padding:12px 15px; font:700 18px ui-monospace,monospace; color:var(--tw-accent); }
  .traffic-orbit :is(i,b,em) { position:absolute; width:10px; height:10px; border:3px solid var(--tw-surface); border-radius:50%; background:#14b8a6; top:10px; right:14px; box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #14b8a666; }
  .traffic-orbit b { top:auto; bottom:6px; left:22px; background:#818cf8; }.traffic-orbit em { top:28px; left:-2px; background:#38bdf8; }
  .traffic-switcher { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin:20px 0; font-size:12px; }
  .traffic-switcher a { padding:9px 13px; border-radius:8px; color:var(--tw-muted); font-weight:650; }.traffic-switcher a.active { color:var(--tw-accent); background:var(--tw-surface); box-shadow:0 1px 4px #0f172a0c; border:1px solid var(--tw-border); }
  .traffic-switcher>span { margin-left:auto; color:var(--tw-muted); font-size:11px; }
  .traffic-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:300px minmax(0,1fr); align-items:start; gap:20px; }
  .traffic-card { border:1px solid var(--tw-border); border-radius:14px; background:var(--tw-surface); box-shadow:0 2px 6px #0f172a03; min-width:0; }
  .traffic-results-column { min-width:0; }
  .traffic-input-card { padding:20px; }.traffic-section-heading { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin-bottom:16px; }
  .traffic-workbench h2 { font-size:14px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-.015em; }.traffic-step { display:block; color:var(--tw-muted); font-size:9px; letter-spacing:.12em; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:5px; }
  .traffic-text-button { font-size:11px; color:var(--tw-accent); font-weight:600; }.traffic-input-label { display:block; font-size:11px; color:var(--tw-muted); margin-bottom:9px; }
  #traffic-input { display:block; width:100%; min-height:265px; resize:vertical; font:12px/1.85 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace; border:1px solid var(--tw-border); border-radius:9px; background:var(--tw-soft); color:var(--tw-ink); padding:12px; }
  #traffic-input::placeholder { color:var(--tw-muted); opacity:.6; }.traffic-input-meta { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:space-between; gap:8px; color:var(--tw-muted); font-size:10px; margin:10px 0 14px; }.traffic-input-meta label { display:flex; gap:5px; align-items:center; }
  .traffic-drop-zone { border:1px dashed var(--tw-border); border-radius:9px; padding:13px 6px; text-align:center; margin-bottom:14px; }.traffic-drop-zone.dragging { border-color:#6366f1; background:#6366f110; }.traffic-drop-zone button { font-size:12px; font-weight:650; color:var(--tw-accent); }.traffic-drop-zone span { display:block; font-size:10px; color:var(--tw-muted); margin-top:4px; }
  .traffic-button { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:12px; border:1px solid var(--tw-border); border-radius:8px; padding:8px 11px; font-size:11px; font-weight:650; background:var(--tw-surface); white-space:nowrap; transition:background .15s,box-shadow .15s; }.traffic-button:hover { background:var(--tw-soft); }.traffic-primary { color:#fff; background:#4f46e5; border-color:#4f46e5; box-shadow:0 3px 8px #4f46e518; }.traffic-primary:hover { background:#4338ca; }.traffic-action-row { display:flex; gap:8px; }.traffic-action-row .traffic-primary { flex:1; padding:11px; }
  .traffic-example { margin-top:22px; padding-top:18px; border-top:1px solid var(--tw-border); }.traffic-example>span { font-size:9px; font-weight:700; color:var(--tw-muted); letter-spacing:.1em; }.traffic-example button { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; width:100%; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; color:var(--tw-accent); margin-top:6px; }
  .traffic-format-help { font-size:11px; color:var(--tw-muted); line-height:1.8; margin-top:18px; }.traffic-format-help summary { cursor:pointer; }.traffic-format-help p { margin-top:10px; }.traffic-workbench code { font-family:ui-monospace,monospace; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
  .traffic-empty { min-height:475px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:36px; text-align:center; background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 15%,#6366f109,transparent 65%),var(--tw-surface); }.traffic-empty h2 { font-size:22px; letter-spacing:-.03em; max-width:350px; margin:28px 0 12px; }.traffic-empty p { color:var(--tw-muted); font-size:13px; line-height:1.8; max-width:375px; }.traffic-empty .traffic-empty-note { font-size:11px; margin-top:25px; }
  .traffic-empty-graphic { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; }.traffic-empty-graphic span { font:9px ui-monospace,monospace; padding:7px; border:1px solid var(--tw-border); border-radius:5px; letter-spacing:.1em; color:var(--tw-muted); }.traffic-empty-graphic i { color:#a5b4fc; }.traffic-empty-graphic b { font-size:28px; color:#6366f1; border:1px solid #6366f140; padding:5px 15px; border-radius:14px; box-shadow:0 8px 25px #6366f110; }
  .traffic-provider-pills { display:flex; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:7px; margin-top:25px; }.traffic-provider-pills span { border:1px solid var(--tw-border); background:var(--tw-soft); padding:5px 8px; border-radius:6px; font-size:10px; color:var(--tw-muted); }
  .traffic-report-heading { padding:18px 20px; display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:14px; }.traffic-report-heading>div { min-width:0; flex:1; }#traffic-title { display:block; width:100%; background:transparent; border:0; font-size:19px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-.03em; padding:0; }#traffic-report-meta { color:var(--tw-muted); font-size:10px; margin-top:5px; }
  .traffic-stats { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:10px; margin-bottom:14px; }.traffic-stat { padding:15px 12px; border:1px solid var(--tw-border); border-radius:11px; background:var(--tw-surface); }.traffic-stat>span { display:block; font-size:10px; color:var(--tw-muted); }.traffic-stat strong { display:block; font-size:25px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-.04em; margin:3px 0; }.traffic-stat small { display:block; color:var(--tw-muted); font-size:9px; }.traffic-stat.highlight { border-color:#6366f140; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f10a,transparent),var(--tw-surface); }.traffic-stat.highlight strong { color:var(--tw-accent); }
  .traffic-chart-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px; margin-bottom:14px; }.traffic-chart-card { padding:18px; }.traffic-section-heading>span,.traffic-section-heading>div>span:not(.traffic-step) { font-size:10px; color:var(--tw-muted); }.traffic-bar-row { margin:11px 0; }.traffic-bar-label { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:10px; font-size:11px; margin-bottom:5px; }.traffic-bar-label span { min-width:0; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap; }.traffic-bar-label b { font-size:10px; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }.traffic-bar-track { height:5px; border-radius:9px; background:var(--tw-soft); overflow:hidden; }.traffic-bar-fill { height:100%; border-radius:9px; background:#818cf8; }
  .traffic-timeline-card { padding:18px; margin-bottom:14px; }#traffic-timeline { display:flex; align-items:end; gap:2px; height:85px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--tw-border); }#traffic-timeline .traffic-time-bar { flex:1; min-width:1px; max-width:35px; background:linear-gradient(#818cf8,#4f46e5); border-radius:3px 3px 0 0; }#traffic-timeline .traffic-time-bar:hover { background:#14b8a6; }.traffic-time-range { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:8px; color:var(--tw-muted); font-size:9px; margin-top:7px; }.traffic-small { font-size:11px; color:var(--tw-muted); line-height:1.7; margin-top:10px; }
  .traffic-table-card { overflow:hidden; margin-bottom:14px; }.traffic-table-card>.traffic-section-heading { padding:18px 18px 0; }.traffic-filters { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:7px; padding:0 18px 16px; }.traffic-filters label:first-child { flex:1 1 160px; }.traffic-filters input,.traffic-filters select { max-width:100%; width:100%; font-size:11px; border:1px solid var(--tw-border); border-radius:7px; padding:8px; background:var(--tw-soft); color:var(--tw-ink); }
  .traffic-table-scroll { overflow:auto; }.traffic-table-scroll table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:11px; text-align:left; }.traffic-table-scroll th { font-weight:600; font-size:9px; color:var(--tw-muted); background:var(--tw-soft); white-space:nowrap; padding:11px 13px; border-block:1px solid var(--tw-border); }.traffic-table-scroll td { padding:12px 13px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--tw-border); vertical-align:middle; }.traffic-table-scroll tr:last-child td { border-bottom:0; }.traffic-table-scroll tbody tr:hover { background:var(--tw-soft); }.traffic-number { text-align:right; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }.traffic-ip-button { color:var(--tw-accent); font-family:ui-monospace,monospace; font-weight:600; text-align:left; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }.traffic-cell-note { display:block; color:var(--tw-muted); font-size:9px; margin-top:4px; max-width:200px; }.traffic-badge { display:inline-block; font-size:9px; font-weight:650; padding:3px 6px; border-radius:4px; color:var(--tw-muted); background:var(--tw-soft); }.traffic-badge-cloud { color:#4f46e5; background:#6366f114; }.traffic-badge-hosting { color:#0369a1; background:#38bdf818; }.traffic-badge-service { color:#7e22ce; background:#c084fc18; }.traffic-badge-crawler { color:#0f766e; background:#14b8a618; }.traffic-badge-cdn { color:#b45309; background:#f59e0b15; }.dark .traffic-badge-cloud { color:#a5b4fc; }.dark .traffic-badge-hosting { color:#7dd3fc; }.dark .traffic-badge-service { color:#d8b4fe; }.dark .traffic-badge-crawler { color:#5eead4; }.dark .traffic-badge-cdn { color:#fcd34d; }
  .traffic-pagination { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; border-top:1px solid var(--tw-border); padding:12px 18px; font-size:10px; color:var(--tw-muted); }.traffic-pagination>div { display:flex; gap:5px; }.traffic-pagination .traffic-button { padding:5px 8px; font-size:10px; }
